{"title": "Heightened Necromancy", "pageid": 11783, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heightened_Necromancy", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Heightened Necromancy</b> is a passive feature that causes creatures to be more likely to fail against your <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy\" title=\"Necromancy\">necromancy spells</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creatures have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against your <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy\" title=\"Necromancy\">necromancy spells</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hollow%27s_Staff\" title=\"Hollow's Staff\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Staff_of_Crones_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hollow%27s_Staff\" title=\"Hollow's Staff\">Hollow's Staff</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy\" title=\"Staff of Cherished Necromancy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Cherished_Necromancy\" title=\"Staff of Cherished Necromancy\">Staff of Cherished Necromancy</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Any Necromancy spell that has a saving throw benefits from Heightened Necromancy. These are:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bursting_Sinew\" title=\"Bursting Sinew\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp/20px-Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp/30px-Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp/40px-Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bursting Sinew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp/20px-Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Bursting_Sinew_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></